<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>This function sets an object to use shouts whenever dialog is triggered. The function sets a variable on the object, that is read and cleared by Generic conversation flags. The flags can then be used to flag a shouts tree in the conversation.
</p><p><br />
</p>
